      "title": "Nam Securities Limited Announces Management Changes, Effective May 27, 2026",
      "body": "Nam Securities Limited informed that Pradeep Kumar was appointed as Executive Director. Appointment with effect from May 27, 2026. Pradeep Kumar is a Commerce Graduate with NISM qualified in NISM III (Compliance Officer), NISM VI (DP segment), NISM VII (Equity Segment), and NISM VIII (Derivative Segment). He is into the business of securities market since the year 2008 and acting as compliance officer since the year 2010. He is also on the board of Nam Credit and Investment Consultants Ltd. as Director. Ashwani Goyal was re-designated from Designated Director to Non-Designated Director with effect from May 27, 2026.",
